    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50681" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππ-ᾰσία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>riding, horse-exercise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1165
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>,=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππάζεσθαι</span>, to take <i>a
			ride</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				8.9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				2.5.33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ. ἱππάσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					11.17
				</span></i>
			; <i>horsemanship</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.5.33
			</span></i>; as a subject of competition, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.3087
			</span></i> (Lebad.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>chariot-driving</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				12.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cavalry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.4.7
			</span></i>.</div>
